.TH GITCRAWL 1 gitcrawl-1.1.0
.SH NAME
gitcrawl \- Web snapshot utility and crawler for Git repositories
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gitcrawl
[\fI-vh\fR]
.I command
[\fIoptions\fR]
[\fIarguments\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gitcrawl
is a fast, lightweight C99 CLI tool that captures web pages and commits their history
directly into Git repositories.
.PP
It strips dynamic noise (scripts, tracking pixels, cookie banners, CSRF nonces),
generates clean, diff-friendly Markdown for rapid inspection via \fBgit diff\fR,
and stores the original compressed HTML and JSON metadata alongside it in Git.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B archive \fIurl\fR
Fetches and archives a single URL into the target Git repository branch.
If stdin is piped, archives standard input.
.TP
.B crawl \fIurl\fR
Recursively crawls a website up to a specified depth and page limit, archiving pages into Git.
Honors robots.txt for the start host, revalidates with stored ETags, and snapshots same-host images and stylesheets.
.TP
.B diff \fIurl\fR [\fIcommit1\fR] [\fIcommit2\fR]
Shows the clean markdown diff of a URL between two revisions or against the previous commit.
.TP
.B search \fIquery\fR
Searches archived URLs, paths, and historical snapshots with fuzzy score ranking.
.TP
.B log \fIurl\fR
Displays the Git commit history and changelog for a specific URL.
.TP
.B show \fIurl\fR
Prints the archived Markdown (\fImd\fR), original compressed HTML (\fIgz\fR), or metadata (\fIjson\fR) for a URL.
.TP
.B list
Lists all archived endpoints in the repository branch.
.TP
.B gc
Optimizes Git packfiles with delta compression and prunes loose objects.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-b " branch"
Target branch name (default: \fIarchive\fR).
.TP
.BI \-d " directory"
Target Git repository directory (default: \fI.\fR).
.TP
.BI \-m " message"
Custom commit message.
.TP
.BI \-l " depth"
Maximum crawl recursion depth (default: \fI1\fR).
.TP
.BI \-p " max_pages"
Maximum number of pages to crawl (default: \fI50\fR).
.TP
.BI \-w " delay_ms"
Delay in milliseconds between crawl requests after the first page (default: \fI0\fR).
.TP
.B \-s
Restrict crawler to the same domain (default: off).
.TP
.BI \-f " format"
Output format for \fBshow\fR (\fImd\fR, \fIhtml\fR, or \fIjson\fR).
.TP
.B \-i
Read content from stdin for the specified URL.
.TP
.B \-z
Enable fuzzy search matching via \fBapprox.h\fR.
.TP
.B \-v
Display version information.
.TP
.B \-h
Display help message.
